WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:03.968
♪♪

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.334
Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.334 --> 00:00:07.200
President Biden
is set to deliver

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.133
his first State of the Union
address on March 1st,

00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:14.801
and it's the first one where
"union" is the only good news.

00:00:14.801 --> 00:00:16.400
Republican senator
Lindsey Graham yesterday

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.033
criticized
President Biden's speech

00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:20.467
commemorating
the January 6th Capitol attack,

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:23.334
and said Biden had
"politicized the event."

00:00:23.334 --> 00:00:27.667
How do you politicize an event
that's already political?

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:31.000
They stormed the Capitol,
not a Best Buy on Black Friday.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.868
That's like saying,
"Is it just me,

00:00:32.868 --> 00:00:38.100
or is the priest's sermon today
all about religion?

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.868
We get it. We get it."

00:00:40.868 --> 00:00:43.267
In a speech last week
commemorating

00:00:43.267 --> 00:00:45.167
the one-year anniversary
of the Capitol attack,

00:00:45.167 --> 00:00:47.868
President Biden criticized
the rioters and said,

00:00:47.868 --> 00:00:50.734
"You can't love your country
only when you win."

00:00:50.734 --> 00:00:52.567
Well, I guess some people

00:00:52.567 --> 00:00:56.200
are just never meant
to fall in love.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.701
Advisors to
former President Trump

00:00:57.701 --> 00:00:59.701
reportedly believe that
a recent improvement

00:00:59.701 --> 00:01:01.334
in Trump's favorability rating

00:01:01.334 --> 00:01:03.667
is due to his diminished
social media presence,

00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:07.033
and at this point,
Biden will try anything.

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:09.901
Scientists are currently
disputing a new study

00:01:09.901 --> 00:01:12.300
that claims to have discovered
a so-called

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:15.300
"deltacron" strain
of the coronavirus

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:18.067
that combines
the delta and omicron variants,

00:01:18.067 --> 00:01:22.801
and the only thing that can
stop it is the Pfizerna vaccine.

00:01:22.801 --> 00:01:24.367
Scientists in England
recently announced

00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:25.934
that they've named
a type of tree

00:01:25.934 --> 00:01:28.267
after actor Leonardo DiCaprio,

00:01:28.267 --> 00:01:31.434
and it's currently dating
a sapling.

00:01:31.434 --> 00:01:34.033
A little tree humor,

00:01:34.033 --> 00:01:36.267
for everybody out there
who's into that kind of thing.

00:01:36.267 --> 00:01:39.067
New York Mayor Eric Adams
is facing criticism

00:01:39.067 --> 00:01:41.634
over his recent decision
to appoint his brother

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:44.000
to serve as
the deputy police commissioner.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.667
Said Adams,
"Cool. Take it up with my son."

00:01:46.667 --> 00:01:49.434
I'm gonna say it right now --

00:01:49.434 --> 00:01:52.667
I think this Mayor Adams thing
is off to a great start --

00:01:52.667 --> 00:01:54.734
insofar as, you know,

00:01:54.734 --> 00:01:56.200
monologue jokes.

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:57.367
Hot start.

00:01:57.367 --> 00:01:59.267
Don't want to jinx it.

00:01:59.267 --> 00:02:01.267
Hot start.

00:02:01.267 --> 00:02:03.334
Mercedes-Benz recently unveiled

00:02:03.334 --> 00:02:07.601
its new
all-electric concept car,

00:02:07.601 --> 00:02:10.100
which is made from
several sustainable materials,

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:13.234
can travel 620 miles
on a single charge,

00:02:13.234 --> 00:02:17.167
and takes up two parking spots.

00:02:17.167 --> 00:02:19.534
BlackBerry last week officially
stopped supporting

00:02:19.534 --> 00:02:21.734
its line of
signature mobile devices.

00:02:21.734 --> 00:02:23.200
Of course,
I was totally prepared,

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:29.133
because I set a reminder
on my PalmPilot.

00:02:29.133 --> 00:02:32.300
And finally, Taco Bell
announced its so-called

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:35.067
"Taco Lover's Pass"
subscription service last week,

00:02:35.067 --> 00:02:38.534
which costs $10 a month
to receive one taco per day

00:02:38.534 --> 00:02:40.834
for 30 consecutive days.

00:02:40.834 --> 00:02:43.133
On the downside,
"Taco Lovers Pass"

00:02:43.133 --> 00:02:46.200
will also be the headline
of their obituary.

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:50.634
Now that's the kind of joke
you can do, you know,

00:02:50.634 --> 00:02:51.968
when you're
in an empty apartment.

00:02:51.968 --> 00:02:54.467
You don't have to worry
about the groans.

00:02:54.467 --> 00:02:55.701
Right?

00:02:55.701 --> 00:02:57.534
Tell the jokes you want to tell

00:02:57.534 --> 00:02:58.767
about Taco Bell.

00:02:58.767 --> 00:03:00.234
What do you mean,
who am I taking to?

00:03:00.234 --> 00:03:02.367
Who are you talking to?

00:03:02.367 --> 00:03:03.701
According to a new survey,

00:03:03.701 --> 00:03:06.367
just 9% of Americans said
that the Biden administration

00:03:06.367 --> 00:03:09.734
is doing a great job handling
the omicron coronavirus strain.

00:03:09.734 --> 00:03:13.834
I assume it's the same 9%
who don't currently have it.

00:03:13.834 --> 00:03:16.100
Oh, you're cocky now.

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:17.567
But it's coming.

00:03:17.567 --> 00:03:18.968
According to a new poll,

00:03:18.968 --> 00:03:21.567
President Biden's
overall disapproval rating

00:03:21.567 --> 00:03:23.467
hit a new high last month,

00:03:23.467 --> 00:03:27.968
or as his aides are phrasing it,
"Your numbers are way up, sir."

00:03:27.968 --> 00:03:29.934
The CDC is reportedly

00:03:29.934 --> 00:03:32.868
considering updating
its coronavirus guidance

00:03:32.868 --> 00:03:37.801
to recommend that people
wear N95 or KN95 masks

00:03:37.801 --> 00:03:42.334
or, barring that, just 95 masks.

00:03:42.334 --> 00:03:45.934
The CDC also issued a
do-not-travel advisory yesterday

00:03:45.934 --> 00:03:49.067
for Canada due to an increase
in coronavirus cases there,

00:03:49.067 --> 00:03:51.100
which is kind of
like Keith Richards

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:55.000
telling you not to hang around
with that pothead from school.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.400
According to new reports,

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:58.400
Senate Democrats have grown
tired of trying to convince

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:00.434
West Virginia Senator
Joe Manchin

00:04:00.434 --> 00:04:02.067
to support
a federal elections bill

00:04:02.067 --> 00:04:05.934
and complained that it's "like
negotiating via Etch A Sketch."

00:04:05.934 --> 00:04:10.467
Which begs the question,
have you tried shaking him yet?

00:04:10.467 --> 00:04:13.067
The federal government
has reportedly approved Facebook

00:04:13.067 --> 00:04:15.901
for hundreds of new patents
over the last few months

00:04:15.901 --> 00:04:17.100
for augmented

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:19.667
and virtual reality technology
they've created.

00:04:19.667 --> 00:04:23.934
It's great for escaping
this hellish actual reality

00:04:23.934 --> 00:04:26.300
which they also created.

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:31.367
The makers of Goldfish have
unveiled a new type of cracker

00:04:31.367 --> 00:04:33.934
that's 50% bigger
than the original snack

00:04:33.934 --> 00:04:36.234
and specifically made
for adults.

00:04:36.234 --> 00:04:38.667
Please, I'm a grown man.

00:04:38.667 --> 00:04:41.100
I'm not gonna eat Goldfish.

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:44.300
I just had two string cheeses
and a Fruit Roll-Up,

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:47.000
and my tummy's a mess.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.767
According to a new documentary,

00:04:48.767 --> 00:04:51.334
"Playboy" founder
Hugh Hefner's pet poodle

00:04:51.334 --> 00:04:53.200
was addicted to cocaine,

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:57.300
though according to my eyes,
all of them are.

00:04:57.300 --> 00:05:00.434
That's right, Hugh Hefner's
poodle was addicted to cocaine,

00:05:00.434 --> 00:05:04.300
which explains why he was
so afraid of the vacuum cleaner.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:07.734
"No! My stash!"

00:05:07.734 --> 00:05:12.501
Yeah, dogs -- dogs on cocaine
sound like Samberg.

00:05:12.501 --> 00:05:14.968
That's just science.

00:05:14.968 --> 00:05:19.300
And finally, Tesla recently
released a new version

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:22.968
of its self-driving software
that allows drivers to select

00:05:22.968 --> 00:05:25.667
among three different
aggression profiles,

00:05:25.667 --> 00:05:30.267
including chill, average,
or New Jersey Turnpike.

00:05:30.267 --> 00:05:33.367
And I'm hearing -- Really?

00:05:33.367 --> 00:05:36.701
Was the 1 millionth
monologue joke

00:05:36.701 --> 00:05:40.300
with the punch line
"New Jersey Turnpike."

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:43.334
Across all talk shows,
since the history of talk shows.

00:05:43.334 --> 00:05:46.234
And is that true?

00:05:46.234 --> 00:05:50.801
I'm gonna get a $10
E-ZPass credit for that.

00:05:50.801 --> 00:05:55.200
So, ha-ha,
things are looking up.

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:57.267
During a speech yesterday
in Atlanta,

00:05:57.267 --> 00:06:00.200
President Biden endorsed
changing the Senate filibuster

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:03.300
in order to pass federal
voting rights legislation

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:05.901
and said, "I'm tired
of being quiet."

00:06:05.901 --> 00:06:07.167
Quiet?

00:06:07.167 --> 00:06:09.968
When did we ever say
we wanted a quiet president?

00:06:09.968 --> 00:06:12.400
Oh, right. Okay, yeah.

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:14.734
Yeah, we may have
put it out there.

00:06:14.734 --> 00:06:17.934
During a hearing yesterday,
Republican Senator Richard Burr

00:06:17.934 --> 00:06:19.734
criticized the
Biden Administration's

00:06:19.734 --> 00:06:21.501
coronavirus pandemic messaging

00:06:21.501 --> 00:06:24.968
and said that the American
people are "confused."

00:06:24.968 --> 00:06:26.400
Said Biden, "It's simple.

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:28.234
Just wear a mask indoors.

00:06:28.234 --> 00:06:29.901
Unless you're indoors,
and then you can

00:06:29.901 --> 00:06:31.334
safely make outdoors indoors

00:06:31.334 --> 00:06:33.601
so long as your booster stays
six feet away

00:06:33.601 --> 00:06:34.767
from sheltering in place."

00:06:34.767 --> 00:06:37.234
Come on, Jack!

00:06:37.234 --> 00:06:38.734
A new op-ed
in "The Wall Street Journal"

00:06:38.734 --> 00:06:41.033
suggests that Hillary Clinton
could be the best

00:06:41.033 --> 00:06:43.901
Democratic nominee for the 2024
presidential election,

00:06:43.901 --> 00:06:46.000
because all voters
really want right now

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:49.100
is someone who admits it
when they lose.

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:51.434
The House committee
investigating the Capitol attack

00:06:51.434 --> 00:06:55.200
has subpoenaed two advisers
to Donald Trump Jr.

00:06:55.200 --> 00:07:01.267
to try to find out
what exactly it is that they do.

00:07:01.267 --> 00:07:02.901
Former President Trump
reportedly hung up

00:07:02.901 --> 00:07:05.734
on NPR journalist
Steve Inskeep yesterday

00:07:05.734 --> 00:07:08.167
just 9 minutes
into a 15-minute interview.

00:07:08.167 --> 00:07:10.067
Though, to be fair, who among us

00:07:10.067 --> 00:07:14.901
hasn't tapped out 9 minutes
into a 15-minute NPR segment?

00:07:14.901 --> 00:07:17.234
I say that as a fan.

00:07:17.234 --> 00:07:19.033
Been there.

00:07:19.033 --> 00:07:21.701
Former Democratic presidential
hopefuls Andrew Yang

00:07:21.701 --> 00:07:23.734
and Marianne Williamson
had dinner on Monday

00:07:23.734 --> 00:07:24.968
in New York City.

00:07:24.968 --> 00:07:28.467
"Please, no photos,"
said the restaurant.

00:07:28.467 --> 00:07:31.901
Kellogg's recently released
a Valentine's Day-themed

00:07:31.901 --> 00:07:37.667
Froot Loops cereal that
includes heart-shaped pieces.

00:07:37.667 --> 00:07:39.434
But if that's
what she wants this year,

00:07:39.434 --> 00:07:41.667
she's too young for you, dude!

00:07:44.133 --> 00:07:45.601
Does it look like
I'm looking at him?

00:07:46.534 --> 00:07:48.334
Listen, you guys know,
in reality,

00:07:48.334 --> 00:07:50.801
I'm just looking at a wall.

00:07:50.801 --> 00:07:54.901
Amazon founder Jeff Bezos
turned 58 years old today.

00:07:54.901 --> 00:07:57.334
If you want to wish him a happy
birthday, just say it out loud.

00:07:57.334 --> 00:08:01.367
I'm sure one of your devices
will get the message to him.

00:08:01.367 --> 00:08:04.267
Pope Francis visited
a record shop in Rome yesterday

00:08:04.267 --> 00:08:05.601
and left with a CD.

00:08:05.601 --> 00:08:07.701
And I gotta say,
I didn't even realize

00:08:07.701 --> 00:08:10.901
the Popemobile had visors.

00:08:10.901 --> 00:08:14.434
Two of our writers
wrote that joke.

00:08:14.434 --> 00:08:16.033
Which is weird,
because all of our writers

00:08:16.033 --> 00:08:18.868
are 22 or younger.

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:22.634
And, finally... [ Laughs ]

00:08:22.634 --> 00:08:25.501
And finally, the Girl Scouts
have partnered with

00:08:25.501 --> 00:08:29.000
the delivery platform DoorDash
to allow local troops

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.901
to sell cookies through the app.

00:08:30.901 --> 00:08:32.467
Meanwhile, the Boy Scouts?

00:08:32.467 --> 00:08:35.734
Still trying to make a fire
with sticks.

00:08:35.734 --> 00:08:39.000
They develop slower.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:41.601
It's just a boy/girl thing.

00:08:41.601 --> 00:08:43.934
Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell yesterday

00:08:43.934 --> 00:08:47.501
called President Biden's speech
in Georgia on voting rights

00:08:47.501 --> 00:08:49.834
"profoundly unpresidential."

00:08:49.834 --> 00:08:53.667
Oh, I'm sorry -- is that
something we still track?

00:08:53.667 --> 00:08:58.167
What should he have said?
Voting is only for 9s and above?

00:08:58.167 --> 00:08:59.968
Senate Majority Leader
Chuck Schumer

00:08:59.968 --> 00:09:03.534
has reportedly found a loophole
that will allow Democrats

00:09:03.534 --> 00:09:05.367
to bypass
a Republican filibuster

00:09:05.367 --> 00:09:07.033
on a new voting rights bill.

00:09:07.033 --> 00:09:08.534
All he had to do to find it

00:09:08.534 --> 00:09:11.834
was push his glasses up
to their normal height.

00:09:11.834 --> 00:09:15.000
"Oh! There it is!"

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:17.334
Confidants of former
Vice President Mike Pence

00:09:17.334 --> 00:09:19.367
reportedly believe
that he is preparing

00:09:19.367 --> 00:09:21.200
to run for president in 2024,

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:25.367
though I think he's just in it
for the security detail.

00:09:25.367 --> 00:09:28.367
Amid accusations of nepotism,
it was announced yesterday

00:09:28.367 --> 00:09:31.868
that New York Mayor Eric Adams
has demoted his brother

00:09:31.868 --> 00:09:33.367
from deputy police commissioner

00:09:33.367 --> 00:09:36.033
to executive director
of mayoral security.

00:09:36.033 --> 00:09:38.534
Still not as bad
as when Mayor Giuliani

00:09:38.534 --> 00:09:43.200
gave his cousin the job of wife.

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:44.834
During a speech --
Sometimes you're bummed

00:09:44.834 --> 00:09:47.334
that there's not
an audience around.

00:09:47.334 --> 00:09:49.667
During a speech yesterday
on the Senate floor,

00:09:49.667 --> 00:09:51.167
Republican Senator Marco Rubio

00:09:51.167 --> 00:09:53.601
described the life
of a typical liberal

00:09:53.601 --> 00:09:56.934
as watching MSNBC,
morning Peloton bike rides,

00:09:56.934 --> 00:10:00.267
drinking caramel macchiatos,
and eating avocado toast.

00:10:00.267 --> 00:10:02.434
Are you kidding me?

00:10:02.434 --> 00:10:05.300
Do you know how many calories
are in a caramel macchiato?

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:09.634
I'm not gonna throw away
my Peloton ride like that.

00:10:09.634 --> 00:10:12.300
Supreme Court heard
oral arguments on Tuesday,

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:14.601
and Justice Neil Gorsuch
was reportedly

00:10:14.601 --> 00:10:16.434
the only member
not to wear a face mask.

00:10:16.434 --> 00:10:20.400
Even worse, they're letting him
play in the Australian Open.

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:22.901
An ex-girlfriend of Republican
congressman Matt Gaetz

00:10:22.901 --> 00:10:26.100
reportedly testified yesterday
before a federal grand jury.

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:28.434
After being thanked
for cooperating, she said,

00:10:28.434 --> 00:10:32.100
"Hey, anything to get out
of gym class."

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:35.434
Organizers of the annual
Toy Fair New York trade show

00:10:35.434 --> 00:10:37.601
canceled the event this week
for the second year in a row

00:10:37.601 --> 00:10:39.200
amid a rise
in coronavirus cases,

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:42.467
which is for the best because
they were about to launch

00:10:42.467 --> 00:10:45.133
the new Cough On Me Elmo.

00:10:45.133 --> 00:10:46.968
Three men were arrested
in New York recently

00:10:46.968 --> 00:10:49.334
after they allegedly
impersonated police officers

00:10:49.334 --> 00:10:51.501
to rob a suspected drug dealer

00:10:51.501 --> 00:10:54.501
of more than $150,000
and 3 kilograms of cocaine.

00:10:54.501 --> 00:10:58.501
Even crazier, the suspected
drug dealer who called the cops.

00:10:58.501 --> 00:11:02.067
"Yeah, I'd like to report
a robbery of some, uh...

00:11:02.067 --> 00:11:04.567
various items."

00:11:04.567 --> 00:11:07.901
Actress Megan Fox
and musician Machine Gun Kelly

00:11:07.901 --> 00:11:09.567
announced their engagement
yesterday

00:11:09.567 --> 00:11:11.567
and said they drank
each other's blood.

00:11:11.567 --> 00:11:13.400
That's right --
he got down on one knee,

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:14.634
then two knees,

00:11:14.634 --> 00:11:16.968
then passed out from blood loss.

00:11:16.968 --> 00:11:18.634
And finally,
according to a new study,

00:11:18.634 --> 00:11:20.634
exercising for 20 minutes a day

00:11:20.634 --> 00:11:22.801
can reduce the risk
of developing dementia.

00:11:22.801 --> 00:11:27.000
Finally, conclusive evidence
that golf is not exercise.

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:31.133
♪♪

